<MainLayout title="About Me">
    <section>
        <h2>About me</h2>
        <p>My name is Philip Pond. I am a polymath dedicated to the pursuit of knowledge and the mastery of traditional crafts.</p>
        <p>By day, I engage in academic research, exploring the frontiers of science and theory. By hand, I practice the ancient art of artisanal plastering, bringing texture and elegance to architectural spaces.</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #ddd;">
            <h3>My Story</h3>
            <p>I am a computer programmer and a media philosopher, interested in the intersection of technology, society, and the production of time.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</MainLayout>
